<title>FRANCE: French March raw steel output up 8.3 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>French March raw steel output up 8.3 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>French raw steel output totalled 1.68 million tonnes in March, up 8.3 percent from the same month a year earlier, figures released by the French steel federation showed.</p>
<p>For the first three months of 1997, steel output totalled 4.67 million tonnes, a rise of 11 percent over the corresponding year-earlier period.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
